      "repairSkill": "ceiling_unintended_consequences",
      "commonError": "judges_policy_only_by_lower_price_for_some_buyers",
      "feedback": "A quantity reduction loses gains from missing beneficial trades. A further allocation loss arises if a lower-value recipient displaces a higher-value applicant. A ceiling does not by itself prove that this misallocation occurs.",
