      "q": "A consultant can attend a workshop or take one of two mutually exclusive Saturday jobs: one pays $480 with $40 travel cost; the other pays $430 remotely. Workshop admission costs $120, including a $50 nonrefundable deposit already paid, and attendance requires $20 travel. From now, what is attendance’s relevant economic cost?",
