      "repairSkill": "full_cost_opportunity_cost_analysis",
      "commonError": "Counting only the workshop fee or only the forgone earnings.",
      "feedback": "The remaining fee is 120-50=70; add 20 travel. The best alternative nets max(480-40,430)=440. Relevant cost is 90+440=530. The nonrefundable deposit is sunk and mutually exclusive jobs are not added.",
