      "feedback": "One bus nets 140-100-30=10. Two net 140+105-200-30=15. Three net 140+105+78+60-300-30=53. The third enables a complementary benefit, so its relevant incremental benefit is 78+60.",
      "bossStage": "final",
      "aHash": "fee7b939555a117cd53aa62802e5253564d936e69959f70535f56d7bc69275de",
      "canonicalId": "ECON-MG-LEGENDARYBOSS-9108",
