      "repairSkill": "market_shift_analysis",
      "commonError": "claims_quantity_change_is_certain_in_opposing_shifts",
      "feedback": "The health information shifts demand right; crop loss shifts supply left. Both raise price, but demand growth raises quantity while the supply contraction lowers it. Their relative sizes determine the quantity change.",
