      "feedback": "Set 10000-2P=1000+P to get P=3000 and Q=4000. At P=2000, Qd=6000 and Qs=3000, a shortage of 3000. Conversion lowers supply to 2500 and raises shortage to 3500. Lower posted rent does not ensure access or exclude search and quality costs.",
