      "repairSkill": "tax_wedge_incidence",
      "commonError": "confuses_who_remits_tax_with_who_bears_tax",
      "feedback": "The wedge is Wf-Ww=8 regardless of remitter. Solve 120-2(Ww+8)=2Ww: Ww=26, Wf=34 and L=52. Without tax W=30. Employer and worker burdens are 4 each, unchanged by the statutory relabeling.",
      "bossStage": "final",
