      "secondarySkills": [],
      "repairSkill": "tax_wedge_incidence",
      "feedback": "Buyer burden is 43-40=3 and seller burden 40-31=9, totaling 12. Shares are 3/12=25% and 9/12=75%. In the standard model the less elastic side bears more, indicating relatively less elastic supply. Legal remittance alone does not alter the wedge equilibrium.",
      "bossStage": "final",
