      "q": "A firm can gain $900 from violating a rule. Detection is currently 10% and the fine is $4,000. Reform A doubles the fine; reform B raises detection to 30% with the original fine. For a risk-neutral firm maximizing expected monetary payoff, which reform deters the violation?",
