      "id": "ERQ-P71-SCAR-LB-001",
      "q": "A convoy can carry 800 food rations or 500 water rations, with a linear payload tradeoff. Relief requires at least 320 food and 200 water. Above those minima, an extra food ration adds 1 benefit point and an extra water ration adds 2. Which feasible load maximizes the stated benefit?",
